<title>USA: Manufactured Home makes $7.4 mln purchase.</title>
<headline>Manufactured Home makes $7.4 mln purchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufactured Home Communities Inc said Thursday it has acquired Golf Vista Estates, a manufactured home community in suburban Chicago, for $7.4 million.</p>
<p>The community has 200 developed sites and 319 expansion sites and is marketed exclusively to retirees, Manufactured Home, a real estate investment trust that owns manufactured home communities, said.</p>
<p>The community includes a nine-hole golf course and luxury clubhouse, Manufactured Home said.</p>
<p>Shares of Manufactured Home were unchanged at 21-7/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
